        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add process and SQLite lock diagnostics",
        "body": "Closes #86.\n\nAdds `gitcrawl doctor --locks --json` for read-only SQLite diagnostics: DB/WAL/SHM/journal state, read-only open status, quick-check status, safe inspection status, and best-effort process detection.\n\nPlatforms without supported process inspection now report that limitation explicitly instead of treating missing process data as proof that no writer exists.\n\nBehavior proof:\nOn a throwaway archive synced for `openclaw/gitcrawl#86`, lock diagnostics reported `db_exists: true`, `read_only_open: \"ok\"`, `quick_check: \"ok\"`, and `safe_read_only_inspection: true`.\n",
